# Armello Rank — App Context Rule

1. Before implementing features or changing behavior, read [`APP_CONTEXT.md`](APP_CONTEXT.md).
2. Treat `APP_CONTEXT.md` as the source of truth for players, scoring, access, APIs, and stack.
3. If you change business rules or CORE (auth, scoring, ranking, player set, API contracts), update `APP_CONTEXT.md` in the same delivery.
4. Prefer project skills under `.cursor/skills/armello-*` for scoped work (frontend, backend, QA, revisor).
5. Do not invent extra players, login systems, or scoring modes unless `APP_CONTEXT.md` is updated first.
